<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/subm/TCA24-A4-SM9> a ipbes:SubMessage ;
    ipbes:SubChapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/TCA24-1.2.2>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/TCA24-1.2.3>,
