        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/TCA24-2.3.2.1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/sch/TCA24-4.2.4> ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Otero, I., Farrell, K. N., Pueyo, S., Kallis, G., Kehoe, L., Haberl, H., Plutzar, C., Hobson, P., García-Márquez, J., Rodríguez-Labajos, B., Martin, J. L., Erb, K. H., Schindler, S., Nielsen, J., Skorin, T., Settele, J., Essl, F., Gómez-Baggethun, E., Brotons, L., … Pe’er, G. (2020). Biodiversity policy beyond economic growth. Conservation Letters," ;
